            <span class="legend-line"><span class="swatch" style="border-top:2px dashed #2222cc;"></span>BBSO</span>
            <span class="legend-line"><span class="swatch" style="border-top:2px dotted #2222cc;"></span>BPSO w/ improved TF</span>
            <span class="legend-line"><span class="swatch" style="border-top:2px solid #cc2222;"></span>MLAO-AGD</span>
            <span class="legend-line"><span class="swatch" style="border-top:2px solid #aaa;"></span>MLAO-AGD (case 1-5)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="xaxis-label">Number of simulations</div>
      </div>
      <figcaption><b>Fig. 9.</b> Convergence rates for the broadband microstrip AGD using different methods and different fitness functions.</figcaption>
    </figure>

