        <div class="label-tag" style="left:44%; bottom:2%; right:2%; text-align:center;">(b)</div>
      </div>

      <figcaption>
        <b>Fig. 10.</b> Optimized DS of the MIMO antenna: (a) top plane and (b) ground plane. $w_1 = 36.9, l_1 = 24, w_2 = 11.15, g_1 = 1.75, g_2 = 1.4$, and $g_3 = 2.7$ (units: mm).
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

